\p
\v 20 The¦31879 people travelled on from¦31876 Succoth¦31876 and¦31877 camped¦31877 at¦31878 Etham¦31878 on¦31879 the edge¦31879 of¦31879 the¦31880 wilderness¦31880.
\v 21 During the day¦31885, Yahweh¦31882 went¦31883 ahead¦31884 of them¦31884 in¦31886 a pillar¦31886 of¦31886 cloud¦31887 to lead them on¦31886 the¦31889 way¦31889, and¦31890 at nighttime¦31890, he went in¦31891 a pillar¦31891 of¦31891 fire¦31892 to be¦31883 light¦31893 to¦31894 them¦31894, \add so they could travel both\add* in the daytime and¦31897 at night¦31897.
