\v 1 Then¦32890 they¦32890 left¦32890 Elim, and¦32892 all¦32893 the Israelis¦32898 entered into¦32899 the¦32901 wilderness¦32901 at¦32910 Siyn (between¦32905 Elim and¦32908 Sinai¦32909) \add ≈around six weeks\add* after¦32915 leaving¦32915 Egypt¦32917,
