\v 6 \add So\add* Mosheh¦33021 and¦33020 Aharon¦33022 told¦33020 all¦33025 the¦33027 Israelis¦33028, “This evening¦33029 you'll all know¦33030 that¦33031 Yahweh¦33032 was the one who brought¦33033 you out¦33033 from¦33035 Egypt¦33036.
