\v 10 And¦33126 so while Aharon¦33113 spoke¦33112 to¦33114 all¦33116 the Israelis¦33121, they¦33122 turned¦33122 toward the¦33125 wilderness¦33125, and¦33111 wow, Yahweh's¦33128 \add dazzling brightness\add* appeared¦33129 in¦33130 the cloud¦33130!
