\p And¦33211 Mosheh¦33212 told¦33198 them¦33213, “It's¦33214 the¦33215 food¦33215 that¦33216 Yahweh¦33218 has¦33217 given¦33217 you all to¦33219 eat.\x + \xo 16:15: \xt 1Cor 10:3.\x*
