\v 15 Then¦33846 Mosheh¦33847 built¦33846 an¦33848 altar¦33848 and¦33846 he¦33849 named¦33850 it¦33849 ‘Yahweh-nissi’ \add (which means ‘Yahweh is my banner’)\add*,
