\v 4 \add Their\add* other son's name¦33920 was¦33922 ‘Eliezer¦33922’ \add (which sounds like the Hebrew word that means ‘God helps me’\add*, because¦33923 Mosheh had said, “God¦33925, who my¦33927 father¦33926 worshipped, has¦33928 helped¦33927 me and¦33928 \add ≈stopped the¦33929 Egyptian king Far'oh¦33930 from¦33929 killing me\add*.”))
\p
