\p
\v 13 The¦34093 following day¦34082, Mosheh¦34084 sat¦34083 down¦34083 to¦34085 judge¦34085 the people, and¦34081 the people¦34088 stood¦34089 around \add *him¦34093\add* from¦34094 morning¦34096 until¦34097 evening¦34099.
