\v 17 “It's¦34169 not¦34173 a good¦34175 \add idea\add* what you're¦34178 doing¦34179,” said¦34169 Yetro¦34171.
\v 18 “You're¦34192 definitely \add on the road to\add* wear yourself¦34182 out, plus you'll¦34182 also wear¦34182 out¦34182 these people¦34188 who are¦34199 with¦34191 you¦34191, because¦34192 the \add responsibility\add* is¦34191 too¦34194 heavy¦34194 for¦34195 you—you can't¦34197 \add just\add* do¦34200 it¦34200 alone¦34201.
\v 19 Now¦34203, listen¦34204 to¦34205 \add this\add*: I'll advise¦34206 you and¦34215 God will¦34215 be with¦34205 you. You¦34206 be¦34207 before God¦34208 for¦34212 the¦34214 people¦34212, and you should¦34207 bring¦34215 their disputes to¦34220 God yourself.
\v 20 You¦34224 should \add also\add* teach them¦34225 the¦34228 statutes¦34228 and¦34229 the¦34231 laws¦34231, and¦34232 you¦34232 should \add teach\add* them¦34233 the¦34236 way¦34236 they¦34237 should \add live\add* and¦34239 the¦34241 work¦34241 that¦34237 they¦34243 should do¦34243.
\v 21 \add But\add* you¦34246 yourself should search through all¦34247 the¦34249 people¦34249 to find capable men¦34250 who¦34257 are godly and faithful¦34256, and not \add greedy for\add* dishonest¦34258 profit. Then¦34245 appoint¦34259 \add the best of them\add* to be over a thousand¦34262 \add >households¦34262\add*, and then¦34245 others to be over groups of one hundred¦34264, fifty¦34266, and¦34267 ten¦34268 \add >households¦34268\add*.
\v 22 They'll \add be the ones to\add* judge¦34270 the¦34273 people¦34273, except that every¦34278 serious situation they'll bring¦34282 to you—they'll judge every minor situation themselves. \add Yes,\add* you must¦34270 lighten¦34291 this load off yourself¦34292, and¦34270 they'll share the load with¦34294 you¦34294.
\v 23 If¦34297 you do¦34301 that¦34300, and¦34302 if God¦34303 tells you \add to proceed\add*, then you'll¦34301 be¦34304 able¦34304 to¦34305 endure¦34305 \add in the long term\add*, plus¦34302 all¦34307 of¦34307 these people¦34309 \add standing around\add* will¦34314 be able to return to their¦34313 tents peacefully¦34315.”
