\v 25 \add *He¦34326\add* chose¦34326 capable men¦34328 from¦34331 among all¦34331 the Israelis¦34339, and he¦34334 appointed them¦34335 as heads¦34336 over¦34337 the people¦34339: leaders¦34340 of¦34340 thousands¦34341, leaders¦34342 of¦34342 hundreds¦34343, leaders¦34344 of¦34344 fifties¦34345, and¦34346 leaders¦34346 of¦34346 tens¦34347 \add of households\add*.
