\v 16 \add So\add* on¦34666 the morning¦34669 of¦34678 the third¦34667 day¦34666, there was¦34670 thunder¦34671 and¦34672 lightning¦34672 and¦34673 a thick cloud¦34673 on¦34675 the¦34677 mountain¦34677, and¦34678 an extremely loud¦34678 horn¦34679 blast, and¦34682 all¦34683 the¦34685 people¦34685 in¦34666 the camp¦34687 were trembling¦34682.\x + \xo 19:16: \xt Rev 4:5.\x*
