\li1
\v 17 You¦35133 mustn't covet¦35133 your¦35147 neighbour's¦35147 house¦35134 or spouse, or their male¦35141 or female¦35142 servants¦35141, or their animals, or anything else they own.\x + \xo 20:17: \xt Rom 7:7; 13:9.\x*
