\v 9 Make¦38406 curtains¦38414 of twisted¦38417 finely-spun linen¦38416 \add to form\add* a courtyard¦38408 \add around\add* the¦38409 residence¦38409. The¦38410 south¦38411 side¦38410 will¦38416 require fifty metres¦38419 of curtain¦38414
\v 10 with twenty \add bronze\add* pillars and¦38426 their¦38426 twenty bases¦38426. The¦38429 hooks¦38429 on the pillars and the clips must¦38425 be¦38432 made of¦38424 silver¦38432.
