\v 15 and¦38491 the same on the other side¦38483.
\v 16 The¦38494 entrance¦38494 curtain must be made¦38506 of¦38494 twisted¦38505 finely-spun linen¦38504. It'll be¦38509 ten metres wide and hang on four¦38509 pillars¦38508 with their¦38510 bases¦38510, and must be embroidered with blue, purple¦38501, and¦38502 scarlet¦38503 yarn.
\v 17 All¦38513 the¦38515 pillars¦38515 for the¦38516 courtyard¦38516 must¦38518 have silver decorations around¦38517 them, as well as their¦38520 silver hooks¦38520 and¦38522 bronze¦38523 bases¦38522.
\v 18 \add So\add* the courtyard¦38526 will¦38527 be¦38527 fifty¦38531 metres by¦38528 twenty-five metres and¦38529 the¦38529 curtain enclosure will¦38531 be¦38531 2.5m high¦38533. All the¦38533 curtains will¦38534 be¦38534 made of¦38538 finely-spun linen¦38536, and¦38538 the bases¦38538 under all the pillars will¦38539 be¦38539 bronze¦38539.
\v 19 All¦38541 the¦38542 equipment¦38542 for the operation of¦38542 the¦38543 residence¦38543 and¦38546 all¦38546 the tent¦38543 pegs¦38548 and¦38549 pegs¦38551 for the¦38552 courtyard¦38552 must¦38553 be¦38553 made of bronze¦38553.
