\v 21 In¦38574 the outer portion of the sacred tent¦38574 (outside¦38576 the curtain¦38577 where the sacred box is¦38579 kept), Aharon¦38584 and¦38585 his¦38585 sons¦38585 must¦38582 attend to¦38590 the¦38590 lampstand in¦38590 front¦38590 of¦38590 Yahweh¦38591 from¦38586 evening¦38586 to morning¦38589. This regulation¦38592 will¦38594 apply continually to¦38594 all future generations¦38594 of¦38596 Israelis¦38597.
