\v 1 \add Now,\add* have your brother¦38606 Aharon and¦38607 his¦38609 sons¦38609 brought¦38601 to¦38614 you from¦38611 among¦38611 the¦38612 Israelis¦38613. Aharon, Nadab¦38618, Abihu¦38619, Eleazar¦38620, and¦38621 Ithamar¦38621 will become my priests¦38614.
