\p
\v 6 They¦38700 must¦38699 make¦38699 the¦38702 sacred apron¦38702 from twisted¦38709 finely-spun linen¦38708 with gold¦38703 \add wire\add* and¦38699 blue, purple¦38705, scarlet¦38707 yarn embroidered onto it by a skilled¦38711 craftsman.
