\v 9 Then¦38740 get¦38740 two¦38743 onyx¦38746 stones¦38744 and¦38747 engrave¦38747 the¦38749 names¦38749 of¦38750 Yisra'el's¦38751 \add twelve\add* sons¦38750 onto them—
