\p
\v 31 Make¦39113 the \bd robe¦39115\bd* \add to be worn under\add* the¦39116 sacred apron¦39116 entirely¦39117 from blue material
\v 32 with¦39124 an¦39125 opening¦39127 for¦39135 his¦39123 head¦39123 in¦39124 the¦39124 middle¦39124 of¦39127 it. A border¦39125 will¦39126 be needed around¦39128 the opening so it can't¦39136 tear¦39137—this should be woven like¦39131 openings¦39131 in regular clothes.
\v 33 Then¦39139 on¦39154 the bottom hem, make¦39139 \add decorations that look like\add* pomegranates—they must¦39139 be¦39154 made¦39139 from blue, purple¦39145, and¦39139 scarlet¦39147 yarn. Gold¦39153 bells¦39152 should hang in¦39154 between¦39154 the pomegranates
\v 34 so as you go around¦39167 the hem of¦39157 the robe¦39166 there'll be¦39163 a gold bell, then a pomegranate, then a gold bell, then a pomegranate, etc.
\v 35 Aharon¦39172 must¦39174 wear this robe when he's¦39176 serving¦39173, so when he goes¦39176 into¦39177 \add *my¦39179\add* presence¦39180 in¦39176 the¦39179 sacred¦39179 inner room¦39179, I'll¦39181 hear¦39174 the bells when he enters and¦39169 when he leaves, so he won't¦39183 die¦39184.
\p
\v 36 Make¦39187 a \add ≈plate¦39188\add* from pure¦39190 gold¦39189 and¦39187 engrave¦39191 ‘Dedicated to¦39196 Yahweh¦39196’ on it¦39192 like you¦39187 would on¦39192 a signet ring.
\v 37 Attach¦39199 it¦39199 to¦39208 the¦39210 front¦39210 of¦39213 the¦39213 turban¦39213 using a blue cord¦39202
\v 38 \add so\add* it'll be¦39216 on¦39217 Aharon's¦39220 forehead. \add In this way,\add* it'll bear¦39221 the¦39225 \add deficiencies of human\add* sinfulness when Israelis¦39230 \add attempt\add* to¦39231 make sacred objects and¦39235 \add attempt\add* to make sacred offerings. Thus it'll be¦39235 on¦39236 his¦39238 forehead continually¦39239 so that¦39227 \add *I¦39229\add* will¦39221 \add see it and\add* accept¦39240 those¦39241 things¦39226.
\p
\v 39 The¦39246 \bd tunic¦39246\bd* must be woven¦39245 from finely-spun linen¦39247, and¦39245 similarly for the \bd turban¦39249\bd*. An embroiderer must make¦39248 the \bd waistband¦39251\bd*.
