\v 40 You¦39258 must¦39258 \add also\add* make¦39260 tunics¦39259, waistbands¦39262 and¦39263 headbands for¦39265 Aharon's¦39257 sons¦39256 so they'll \add look\add* splendid and beautiful¦39267.
\v 41 Put these clothes¦39269 on your brother¦39274 Aharon¦39273 and¦39275 his¦39277 sons¦39277, then¦39269 anoint¦39279 them¦39280 \add with oil\add* and¦39281 ordain¦39281 and¦39285 consecrate¦39285 them¦39286 as¦39287 priests¦39287 to¦39288 me¦39288.
\v 42 Make¦39290 \bd underwear¦39292\bd* out of¦39292 linen¦39294 to¦39295 cover¦39295 their bare flesh¦39296 from¦39298 the¦39298 waist¦39298 to¦39299 the¦39301 thighs¦39301—
\v 43 they must wear¦39326 it¦39329 whenever they enter the sacred¦39323 tent¦39323 and whenever they approach¦39318 the¦39321 altar¦39321 to¦39322 offer sacrifices so they won't¦39324 be¦39329 disobeying and die¦39328. Aharon¦39307 and his¦39332 descendants¦39332 must obey that rule forever¦39330.
\c 29
