\v 34 If¦39948 any meat¦39939 of¦39939 the¦39940 consecration or any of the¦39943 bread¦39943 remains until¦39944 the¦39946 morning¦39946, then¦39936 you¦39947 must¦39938 burn¦39947 the¦39950 remainder¦39950—it can't¦39952 be¦39953 eaten¦39953 because¦39954 it's¦39957 been made sacred¦39956.
\p
