\v 13 Tell¦40883 the Israelis¦40882 that you all must¦40888 certainly observe¦40888 the \add weekly\add* rest day because¦40889 \add @the rest day\add* is¦40890 a sign¦40890 between¦40892 me¦40892 and¦40893 you all throughout¦40894 your¦40899 generations¦40894, so that you will¦40888 know¦40895 that¦40896 I¦40897 am¦40898 Yahweh¦40898, who¦40899 \add ≈wants to¦40879 distinguish you from other nations\add*.
