\v 15 There's¦40933 six¦40924 days¦40925 for¦40933 working, and¦40928 then the¦40936 seventh¦40929 is a rest day—\add ≈dedicated¦40932\add* to \add *me¦40933\add*. Anyone¦40936 who¦40936 works on¦40928 it¦40926 must¦40926 certainly¦40940 be¦40941 put¦40941 to¦40941 death¦40941.\x + \xo 31:15: \xt Exo 20:8-11; 23:12; 34:21; 35:2; Lev 23:3; Deu 5:12-14.\x*
