\v 2 Aharon¦41046 \add ≈replied¦41044\add*, “Go and get the¦41048 gold¦41049 earrings off¦41047 your wives¦41052 and your sons¦41053 and¦41054 daughters¦41054, and¦41055 bring¦41055 them¦41055 to¦41056 me¦41056.”
