\v 13 Remember¦41233 Abraham¦41234 and Yitshak¦41235 and¦41236 Yisra'el¦41236—your¦41237 servants¦41237 that¦41254 you swore¦41239 to¦41240 them¦41240 yourself and¦41242 told them¦41243, ‘I will¦41244 cause your descendants to increase¦41244 like¦41248 the¦41248 stars¦41248 in the¦41249 sky¦41249, and¦41250 I will¦41256 give¦41256 your descendants all¦41250 this¦41253 land¦41252 which¦41254 I told you about¦41247, and¦41258 they¦41258 will¦41258 inherit¦41258 it forever.’ ”\x + \xo 32:13: \xt Gen 22:16-17; Gen 17:8.\x*
