\p
\v 10 \add @Yahweh¦42321\add* said¦42289, “Listen, I'm about¦42292 to¦42292 make¦42292 an agreement¦42293 in front¦42294 of all¦42295 your¦42297 people.\f + \fr 34:10 \ft Because there's no punctuation in the original Hebrew, it's not certain if ‘in front of all your people’ goes with what it follows (as the \+em OET-RV\+em* has chosen), or with what follows it (as in several other translations).\f* I¦42298 will¦42298 do¦42298 miracles¦42299 that¦42300 have¦42303 not¦42301 been¦42303 \add ≈done before¦42294\add* anywhere on¦42304 the¦42306 earth¦42306 or in any country¦42306 \add of the world\add*. All¦42307 the people¦42313 that¦42314 you're¦42316 among will see¦42310 \add *my\add* work¦42320, because¦42322 what I'm going to¦42328 do¦42328 with¦42329 you is¦42324 \add ≈awe-inspiring\add*.
