\v 14 You¦42385 must¦42385 not¦42384 bow¦42385 down¦42385 to¦42386 any other god¦42386 because¦42388 Yahweh¦42389 is¦42390 a jealous God¦42386—jealous¦42390 \add to protect\add* his¦42391 name¦42391.
