\p
\v 29 \add ≈So¦42635 when¦42636\add* Mosheh¦42637 came¦42636 down¦42636 from¦42638 Mt¦42649. Sinai¦42639, he was carrying the¦42640 two¦42640 \add stone\add* slabs with the transcript¦42642 \add of the ten commands\add*, \add ≈but¦42635\add* what he didn't¦42651 know¦42653 as he descended was that¦42654 the¦42656 skin¦42656 on¦42636 his face¦42657 was shining¦42655 after his talking¦42658 with¦42659 \add @Yahweh¦42659\add*.\x + \xo 34:29-35: \xt 2Cor 3:7-16.\x*
