\v 32 After¦42692 that, the¦42698 Israelis¦42699 came¦42695 closer, and¦42700 \add @Mosheh¦42695\add* gave them¦42700 all¦42702 the instructions¦42700 that¦42704 Yahweh¦42706 had¦42705 told¦42700 him¦42707 on¦42708 Mt¦42708. Sinai¦42709.
